{"id":"15F","title":"Causes of Poverty","part":{"n":15,"title":"General welfare"},"url":"/law/15-general-welfare/15f","entries":[{"id":"15F.1","text":"Poverty is derived from laziness and a lack of work effort.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":6,"verses":"10-11"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":19,"verses":"15,24"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":20,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":21,"verses":"25"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":24,"verses":"30-34"},{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":9,"verses":"6"},{"book":"2 Thessalonians","chapter":3,"verses":"8-12"}],"citation":"Prov. 6:10-11; Prov. 19:15, 24; Prov. 20:4; Prov. 21:25; Prov. 24:30-34; 2 Cor. 9:6; 2 Thes. 3:8-12."},{"id":"15F.2","text":"He who loves pleasure will become a poor man.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":21,"verses":"17"}],"citation":"Prov. 21:17."},{"id":"15F.3","text":"Poverty will come to him who refuses instruction and is unwilling to learn.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":13,"verses":"18"}],"citation":"Prov. 13:18."},{"id":"15F.4","text":"He who follows empty pursuits will have poverty in plenty.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":28,"verses":"19"}],"citation":"Prov. 28:19."},{"id":"15F.5","text":"Idle chatter leads only to poverty.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":14,"verses":"23"}],"citation":"Prov. 14:23."},{"id":"15F.6","text":"Poverty will come to the drunkard and the glutton.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":23,"verses":"21"}],"citation":"Prov. 23:21."},{"id":"15F.7","text":"He who oppresses the poor to increase his riches will surely come to poverty.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":22,"verses":"16"}],"citation":"Prov. 22:16."},{"id":"15F.8","text":"Poverty caused by love of sleep.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":6,"verses":"9-11"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":20,"verses":"13"}],"citation":"Prov. 6:9-11; Prov. 20:13."},{"id":"15F.9","text":"God will not allow the soul of the righteous to famish, but He casts away the substance of the wicked.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":10,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"Prov. 10:3."},{"id":"15F.10","text":"He becomes poor that deals with a slack hand, but into the hand of the diligent comes wealth.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":10,"verses":"4"}],"citation":"Prov. 10:4."}]}